 merged which the world looks rather alien which I wonder how alien would Earth look like it's merged with the Umbra?<br /> <br /> I also wonder who in the WoD canon exactly has this goal? I think it could after serve as the &amp;quot;best case scenario apocalypse&amp;quot; especially averting the Technocratic predicted future of the Earth gobbled up by the sun six billion years from now with the world &amp;quot;now immortal and lasts forever&amp;quot; therefore not worrying any other ones.<br /> <br /> Of course with the Earth and Umbra merged, how would supernaturals cope with it especially Vampires? Well could have it business as usual with Vampires except it takes place cross between Earth and a alien landscape or maybe it could go back to the Dark Ages gamelines..</div> </div> </div> </div>You basically end up with something very similar to exalted, you just change some of the fluff","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T20:34:27-07:00","id":992734,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged?p=992722#post992722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You basically end up with something very similar to exalted, you just change some of the fluff</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess if this was the case then I guess it would no longer be the &quot;World of Darkness&quot; anymore which also means that Vampires/Kindred would be upgraded to Abyssal Exalted (as they're originally were) and Garou would be upgraded to Lunar Exalted for example...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","name":"Veindark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T23:35:57-07:00","id":992808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged?p=992722#post992722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You basically end up with something very similar to exalted, you just change some of the fluff</div> </div> </div> </div>No, Creation isn't in nearly as much shit as the WoD, and spirits work very differently between the two games.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T09:58:28-07:00","id":992994,"title":"","content":"In the 1800s the Storm Eater tore gaping holes in the Gauntlet and merged the two worlds on a smaller scale. People and animals got ravaged and those that weren't consumed became warped hybrids of flesh and spirit. I think similar things would happen if the barrier between realities were to break... as Saur noted, many spirits are inhuman to the point of insanity (as well as being powerful). Even if they are not Wyrm-bent, they are not going to play well with others, be they supernatural or mortal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-06T10:43:42-08:00","id":999306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged?p=992808#post992808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, Creation isn't in nearly as much shit as the WoD, and spirits work very differently between the two games.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's why I said very similar. It couldn't be exact because the spirits in wod don't match up to exalted and the realms of existence don't match up. You would have something similar because a coilition of powerful spirits and other entities would eventually lord over the world, the farther away from the center of whatever reality is the more you would have weaker entities playing kings, queens, and other similar roles until you get to the edges of reality and then you have the things that existed before time waiting for their chances to do whatever it is they want to do","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-07T11:35:46-08:00","id":999837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Veindark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged#post992142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also wonder who in the WoD canon exactly has this goal? I think it could after serve as the &quot;best case scenario apocalypse&quot; especially averting the Technocratic predicted future of the Earth gobbled up by the sun six billion years from now with the world &quot;now immortal and lasts forever&quot; therefore not worrying any other ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can think at least of two circumstances someone (or a group thereof) would be inclined to try and merge the Umbra with the Skinlands. The first case, notably, is even a quote from the W20 Umbra: the Velvet Shadow book, at page 16:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Some Garou theorize that the Penumbra is the world as Gaia sees it, and so it is idealized \u2014 at least in those few places where the Apocalypse war has not shattered the balance entirely. Theurges take this belief a step further. The Penumbra and the physical merged is the way Gaia once was, before the Gauntlet \u2014 and to heal the world, the barrier must come down. </div> </div> </div>Another case where I can see it happening is an Examplar of the Spirit Sphere (quite possibly wielding Spirit 8's Remember the One rote) as follows:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Remember the One</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although some Choristers hearing of this power consider it rather blasphemous, this is only because they are completely wrong about what it does. This power allows the Archmage to bring overlapping Realms together, with no Gauntlet between. It is named for the mythical First Age, when all Realms were one.<br /> <br /> [By scoring three successes for each point of the Gauntlet, the mage can pull together overlapping Realms. Additional successses add to the duration at one-third the usual rate. Realms pulled together this way are not harmed and are treated as whole and complete locations where their inhabitants my interact. Typically, this functions only over a small area - use the range chart with one-third the normal values. When the Realms split apart again, creatures return to their native planes, even if they had somehow crossed over beforehand.]</div> </div> </div> </div>As a way to extend their control and influence over the Skinlands given their superb control over all that concerns Spirit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12152-rotwood","name":"Rotwood","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T16:41:04-08:00","id":1002399,"title":"","content":"Well to clarify I think the reason to merge the Earth with the Umbra or 'bringing back the mythical ages' is to prevent <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timeline_of_the_far_future\" target=\"_blank\">all this</a> from happening which would make our far future less bleaker since this is the real danger that the Technocratic paradigm presents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12524,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","user":"Veindark","date":". 11-12-2016, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","name":"Veindark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T18:37:17-08:00","id":1002415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Veindark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged?p=1002399#post1002399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well to clarify I think the reason to merge the Earth with the Umbra or 'bringing back the mythical ages' is to prevent <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timeline_of_the_far_future\" target=\"_blank\">all this</a> from happening which would make our far future less bleaker since this is the real danger that the Technocratic paradigm presents.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would happen, with or without Technocrats. Unless you were playing a really strongly-Mage game that got very first edition with the cosmology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-12T20:36:38-08:00","id":1002452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-umbra-merged?p=1002415#post1002415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That would happen, with or without Technocrats. Unless you were playing a really strongly-Mage game that got very first edition with the cosmology.</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems first edition Mage got the concept working properly like it's supposed to or otherwise it's not Mage at all. and plus it also allows &quot;All Myths are True&quot; scenarios much easier.<br /> <br /> The whole idea comes from that the Technocratic cosmology makes humanity insignificant therefore far more likely leading to our own extinction if we had no supernatural presence anywhere (or rather removing ourselves from the supernatural world) which also allows Nephandic additions hence the Lovecraften scenarios (like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ep_1k-lOto8\" target=\"_blank\">Galaxy Eating Eldritch Abominations</a> for example or basically the only way to properly crossover Call of Cthulhu with the WoD only if there's Nephandic influence behind the Lovecraft Mythoes without rewriting everything since they're really Nephandic corruptions on the Technocratic paradigm and it's cosmology) all based on the dangers of making ourselves insignificant whilst the Tradition paradigms/cosmologies puts humanity as significant to the universe around us which even the SoE paradigms are based on Pre and early 20th century outlooks of cosmology where there's life in all nine planets including the Moon and even the Sun itself which are comparably optimistic compared to the otherwise cold pessimistic outlook of the Technocrat cosmology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12524,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","user":"Veindark","date":". 11-13-2016, 12:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12524-veindark","name":"Veindark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-13T12:06:54-08:00","id":1002592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Veindark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/992142-earth-and-um